cff-version: 1.2.0
title: scamscript
message: If this tool contributes to published research, cite the repository at the version used.
type: software
authors:
  - name: scamscript contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/sjdsjadjajdjsa/scamscript
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reverse-engineering analyzer for leaked and public scam call scripts and vishing transcripts.
  Turns a script into a validated breakdown of persona, hook, trust moves, urgency, escalation,
  red flags and a counter-playbook.
keywords:
  - security
  - fraud
  - vishing
  - smishing
  - social engineering
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
